1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,118
At this hotel, you can watch the fountains of Bellagio from your dinner table.

2
00:00:05,168 --> 00:00:09,621
And that is only the start of a Las Vegas stay at the Bellagio.

3
00:00:09,671 --> 00:00:13,989
Here is how I would plan a trip for two, and why couples love it here.

4
00:00:14,039 --> 00:00:16,756
Stay to the end for my honest score.

5
00:00:16,806 --> 00:00:19,007
Start outside, with the fountains.

6
00:00:19,057 --> 00:00:23,528
They are about three minutes away on foot, and the Cosmopolitan is five.

7
00:00:23,578 --> 00:00:29,744
Inside, a botanical garden fills the atrium with flower displays that change with the seasons.

8
00:00:29,794 --> 00:00:33,987
Walk through it slowly, and you are already on vacation.

9
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:35,399
Now your room.

10
00:00:35,449 --> 00:00:40,629
The standard rooms are five hundred ten square feet, and many look out over the Strip.

11
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:46,726
Guests score the Premier King eight point eight out of ten, from more than twelve hundred reviews.

12
00:00:46,776 --> 00:00:51,337
Want more space? There are suites over two thousand square feet.

13
00:00:51,387 --> 00:00:52,697
Then the pools.

14
00:00:52,747 --> 00:00:57,002
There are five outdoor pools and four hot tubs, with sun loungers.

15
00:00:57,052 --> 00:01:03,127
In more than three hundred reviews, guests call the pool area huge, sparkling, and clean.

16
00:01:03,177 --> 00:01:07,997
The spa has fifty treatment rooms, including rooms for couples.

17
00:01:08,047 --> 00:01:08,972
Now dinner.

18
00:01:09,022 --> 00:01:11,667
There are seventeen restaurants and five bars.

19
00:01:11,717 --> 00:01:17,887
Reservations are required at Prime Steakhouse, Lago, and Mayfair Supper Club, so book early.

20
00:01:17,937 --> 00:01:21,317
Guests praise the food in nearly four hundred reviews.

21
00:01:21,367 --> 00:01:27,877
After dinner, the casino has one hundred thirty six tables and two thousand three hundred slot machines.

22
00:01:27,927 --> 00:01:30,683
A few things to know, so you enjoy it even more.

23
00:01:30,733 --> 00:01:36,255
There are resort fees, paid at the hotel, so check what they include before you go.

24
00:01:36,305 --> 00:01:40,765
There is also a deposit at check in, and parking costs extra.

25
00:01:40,815 --> 00:01:44,960
Pools are open from nine to four, and spa treatments need a reservation.

26
00:01:45,010 --> 00:01:47,740
You must be twenty one to check in.

27
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:49,295
So who is this for?

28
00:01:49,345 --> 00:01:56,530
Couples and first time visitors who want fountains, gardens, great food, and a pool, all in one place.

29
00:01:56,580 --> 00:02:01,260
Guests score it nine point zero out of ten, from more than fifteen thousand reviews.

30
00:02:01,310 --> 00:02:05,785
My honest score: nine out of ten, and I would send a couple here.

31
00:02:05,835 --> 00:02:08,370
That's the Bellagio.
